@node Histo "History of MS-Comment"

June 1993  -  first Version written in AREXX
Dec  1993  -  small changes in the AREXX Code
Feb  1994  -  totally rewritten in C, first beta Version
Feb  1994  -  v1.2 Release Version
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
[03-08-94] Dr.Dre!/tRZ

Another Bug in the Comment.x found and fixed now it dont will allocate any
memory and steal it..
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
[03-09-94] Dr.Dre!/tRZ

CHANGES IN THE MS-COMMENT 1.2 to 1.2a
Now you can call C 1 for Sysop #1 or C 5 for Sysop #5 and so on.
Thanx to XTC! for this Suggestion.

New ToolTypes:
--------------
FORWARD_FROM=<#>
FORWARD_TO=<#>
This means you can now forwarding Mails from one Sysop to another Sysop.
If you want forwarding masil from Sysop #1 to Sysop #5 then set the
ToolTypes like this example.
FORWARD_FROM=1
FORWARD_TO=5
now are going all mails for sysop #1 to sysop n5 this is really usefull if
you go in Hollidays or so...
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
15-Mar-94 - Totally rewritten in a faster Code and with more Options.
19-Mar-94 - Add on a Suggestion from AMICOM/MST a new ToolTypes which
            allwos you to add a seperate Line between the Sysops and
            CoSysops.
            many thanx for this Suggestion looks nice...
19-Mar-94 - MS-Comment 1.3 final release Version

                             @{" Main Menu "Link MAIN} @{" Exit "QUIT}

@endnode

